  "notes": "Addon Adder 1.23: the wake fix. Holding a dormant imp item on its job block used to wake a whole swarm of imps - one held use made eleven Sprout Imps - because the game re-fires the use action for as long as you hold it and every fire spawned another imp. Now the first imp to wake claims the block and every repeat fire stands down: one hold, one imp, proven in-game (the count after a single held use is exactly one). Fixed packs: Cinder Imp 1.3.6, Bubble Imp 1.1.7, Sprout Imp 1.1.7, Lumen Imp 1.1.6, Ledger Imp 1.1.6, Shepherd Imp 1.1.6, Fisher Imp 1.1.6. Cinder also stops stranding fractional XP in his belly (banked XP now rounds cleanly). Porter, Feral, The Listener and Rogue Village are unchanged. Eighteen add-ons built in in all.",
  "versionCode": 24,
  "versionName": "1.23"
 }
